    "body": "# Description\n\nFixes nightly builds failing with\n\n```\n+ cmake --build build --target test_ep\n[1/3] Building CUDA object CMakeFiles/test_ep.dir/test_ep.cu.o\n[2/3] Building CUDA object CMakeFiles/test_ep.dir/opt/transformerengine/tests/cpp/test_common.cu.o\n[3/3] Linking CXX executable test_ep\nFAILED: [code=1] test_ep \n: && /usr/bin/c++  -Wl,-rpath -Wl,/usr/local/mpi/lib -Wl,--enable-new-dtags CMakeFiles/test_ep.dir/test_ep.cu.o CMakeFiles/test_ep.dir/opt/transformerengine/tests/cpp/test_common.cu.o -o test_ep -L/usr/local/cuda/targets/x86_64-linux/lib -Wl,-rpath,/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine:/usr/local/cuda/lib64:/opt/hpcx/ompi5/lib  lib/libgtest.a  /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so  /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libnccl.so  /usr/local/cuda/lib64/libcudart.so  /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libcuda.so  /usr/local/cuda/lib64/libnvrtc.so  /opt/hpcx/ompi5/lib/libmpi.so  /usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-linux-gnu/13/libgomp.so  /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libpthread.a  -lcudadevrt  -lcudart_static  -lrt  -lpthread  -ldl && :\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyDict_SetItemString'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyImport_ImportModule'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyErr_Print'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyGILState_Ensure'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `_Py_NoneStruct'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `Py_DecRef'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyGILState_Release'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `Py_Initialize'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyObject_IsTrue'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyImport_GetModuleDict'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyEval_SaveThread'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyObject_CallMethod'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `Py_IsInitialized'\n/usr/bin/ld: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/transformer_engine/libtransformer_engine.so: undefined reference to `PyErr_Occurred'\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\nninja: build stopped: subcommand failed.\n```\n\n## Type of change\n\n- [ ] Documentation change (change only to the documentation, either a fix or a new content)\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\n- [ ] Infra/Build change\n- [ ] Code refactoring\n\n## Changes\n\nPlease list the changes introduced in this PR:\n\n- Fix builds failing when `NVTE_WITH_CUTEDSL` is enabled\n\n# Checklist:\n\n- [ ] I have read and followed the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/NVIDIA/TransformerEngine/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.rst)\n- [ ] The functionality is complete\n- [ ] I have commented my code, particularly in hard-to-understand areas\n- [ ] I have made corresponding changes to the documentation\n- [ ] My changes generate no new warnings\n- [ ] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective or that my feature works\n- [ ] New and existing unit tests pass locally with my changes\n",
